  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3e4b5683c1ea36345958694d590b6436, type: 3}
  m_Name: COC3_Quiz_Final_Review_Q05
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizQuestionData
  questionText: Why does the job order end with a service report?
  choices:
  - It is needed to close the software licence
  - It is the only record of what was configured, what was tested and what the result
    was
  - It is required before the server can be restarted
  - It replaces the test plan
  correctChoiceIndex: 1
  points: 10
  explanation: Undocumented work cannot be handed over, verified, or repeated by
    whoever comes next. The report is what the client is actually paying for.
